This is what you will do

You will be working at a large company in Zoetermeer where different types of meat products are produced that the whole of the Netherlands eats on their sandwich every morning. You can think of grill sausage, minced meat, filet american and much more! This organization has been active in the food industry for years and is a regular supplier of various supermarket chains throughout the Netherlands such as Jumbo, Lidl and Plus.

Within this company there is no slaughtering! The slaughtered meat within the production area is only processed into a final product that ends up in the supermarkets. This means you will be working in an environment where hygiene (NVWA and BRC) is very important!

As a Production Employee you will work together with your colleagues to produce various meat products according to the planning. The following tasks belong to your function:

- Packaging of meat products;
- Keeping track of the production process and assisting where necessary;
- Reading production receipts and planning;
- Checking articles for correct labels and shelf life;
- Producing according to the planning;
- Supplying machines;

You will be working in a day shift from Monday to Friday. The working hours may vary due to the supermarket orders. In any case, you will start at 06:00 or 07:00 in the morning and end your day between 15:00 and 17:00. After this you can enjoy the weekend and you are free!

This is who you are

- Living in the area of Rotterdam, Den Haag, Zoetermeer, Leiden, Waddinxveen, Capelle aan den IJssel, Alphen aan den Rijn or Woerden;
- Willing to work in a multicultural team;
- Willing to work fulltime and work overtime when there are rush orders;
- You speak the English or Dutch language;
- Able to perform work at a fast pace;
- You can be present every morning at 06:00 or 07:00.

